          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a^{\\frac12}\\times a^{\\frac13}&=a^{\\frac12+\\frac13}\\\\a^{\\frac12}\\times a^{\\frac13}&=a^{\\frac36+\\frac26}\\\\a^{\\frac12}\\times a^{\\frac13}&=a^{\\frac56}\\end{align*}$$",
