          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}p^{\\frac23}\\div p^{\\frac12}&=p^{\\frac23-\\frac12}\\\\p^{\\frac23}\\div p^{\\frac12}&=p^{\\frac46-\\frac36}\\\\p^{\\frac23}\\div p^{\\frac12}&=p^{\\frac16}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
